IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. CLM0016.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-IN-REC.
    COPY CLM0016C.
01 WS-OUT-REC.
    05 CLM-STAT-CD        PIC X VALUE 'A'.
        88 CLM-APPROVED VALUE 'A'.
        88 CLM-INVESTIGATE VALUE 'I'.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PARA.
    ACCEPT WS-IN-REC
    PERFORM TRIAGE-CLAIM
    DISPLAY "CLM-STAT-CD=" CLM-STAT-CD
    STOP RUN.
TRIAGE-CLAIM.
    *>  OLD CHECK REMOVED 2004
    *>  IF CLM-AMOUNT <= 800
    *>      PERFORM 9000-OLD-HANDLING
    *>  END-IF
    EVALUATE TRUE
        WHEN CLM-AMOUNT NOT > 1000
           AND PREV-CLM-CNT < 2
            SET CLM-APPROVED TO TRUE
        WHEN CLM-AMOUNT > 40000
            MOVE 'I' TO CLM-STAT-CD
        WHEN POLICY-TENURE LESS THAN 6
            SET CLM-INVESTIGATE TO TRUE
        WHEN OTHER
            SET CLM-APPROVED TO TRUE
    END-EVALUATE.
